      "html" : "<ScrollTable><div class=\"xsl-table xsl-table--header\"><table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"62.5%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Installation<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Continuous<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Periodic<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><div class=\"xsl-table xsl-table--body\"><table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"62.5%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Installation<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Continuous<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Periodic<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">1.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Casing Installation.<\/span> Special inspector shall observe casing installation and confirm that anchors are installed through a fully cased borehole or installed through stable rock in an open hole drill hole.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Anchor Materials.<\/span> Special inspector shall confirm that the materials used in prestressed rock and soil anchors conform Section 1815.3 and approved construction documents. Inspector shall confirm that bar tendons conform to ASTM A 722 and that strand tendons conform to ASTM A 416 or A 882.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">3.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Anchor Installation.<\/span> Special inspector shall confirm the preparation and installation of each anchor, including placement, type, size and location of anchors, accessories, corrosion protection and grout conforms to PTI DC35.1-4 and the approved construction documents.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">4.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Grout.<\/span> At the time of grout placement, special inspector shall prepare 3\" diameter grout cylinders at the intervals specified in Section 1812.1.1.2.1. Cylinders shall be prepared in accordance with ASTM C 31\/C 31M.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">5.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Grout.<\/span> At the time of grout placement, special inspector shall determine the specific gravity of grout in accordance with American Petroleum Institute (API) Recommended Practice 13B-1 or in accordance with ASTM C 138.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">6.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of Grout.<\/span> The compressive strength of grout cylinders shall be verified using 3\" diameter cylinders tested in accordance with ASTM C 39 and Section 1812.1.1.2.2.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">7.<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;Special inspection of Load Test.<\/span> The special inspector shall observe load testing of each anchor and confirm that the test is accordance with PTI DC35.1-14 (Sections 8.1 - 8.9) and Section 1815.5. Inspector shall confirm that testing lock-off, and test loads comply with approved construction documents and PTI DC35.1-14 (Sections 8.1 - 8.9).<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><tfoot><tr><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot><\/table><\/div><\/ScrollTable>",
